A '''Spooky Fragment''' is an {{Epic}} item dropped by the {{MobSprite|Headless Horseman}}. It is used to craft certain items from the [[Spooky Festival]].

== Obtaining ==
'''Spooky Fragments''' are dropped by the {{MobSprite|Headless Horseman}}. If a {{MobSprite|Headless Horseman}} is killed, the player who spawned it receives {{Item|Spooky Fragment|amount=4}}s, the first place damager receives {{Item|Spooky Fragment|amount=1}}, and the second place damager receives {{Item|Spooky Fragment|amount=1}} if they dealt over half of the {{Stat|damage}} dealt by the first place damager.

